<div style="background:#fff;"><div class="cap-section"><div style="margin-bottom:44px;"><div class="why-grid why-grid--single"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-panel);padding:32px 30px;background:linear-gradient(152deg,#155F9B 0%,#0E4A7C 46%,#0A3860 100%);border:none;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:18px;"><img src="/images/hana-mark-white.svg" alt="" style="width:36px;height:36px;display:block;flex:none;"><span style="flex:1;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.24);"></span></div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:23px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 12px;text-wrap:balance;">Controlled sealing with verified hermeticity</h3><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.84);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;">Hermetic packaging relies on a controlled cavity rather than encapsulation. The lid is welded or seam-sealed under nitrogen, and the finished package is leak-tested to verify that the cavity remains protected.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Cap welding and seam sealing instead of encapsulation</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Sealing performed under nitrogen</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Fine and gross leak testing on sealed product</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Molded packaging available when a hermetic cavity is not required</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div>
<div style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);"><div class="cap-section"><div style="margin-bottom:8px;"><div style="margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;">Where we run it</h2><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:15.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;max-width:640px;margin:10px 0 0;">Hermetic and ceramic packaging is available across our OSAT network; production mix varies by site.</p></div><div class="cap-grid-4"><a href="/locations/ayutthaya" style="text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:22px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;"><div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-bottom:7px;"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:14px;height:14px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:var(--hana-blue);">Thailand</span></div><div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.01em;">Ayutthaya</div></div><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hana-blue);">Explore Ayutthaya <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a href="/locations/jiaxing" style="text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:22px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;"><div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-bottom:7px;"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:14px;height:14px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:var(--hana-blue);">China</span></div><div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.01em;">Jiaxing</div></div><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hana-blue);">Explore Jiaxing <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div></div>
<div style="background:#fff;"><div class="cap-section"><div style="margin-bottom:8px;"><div style="margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;"><details class="sc-faq" open><summary>Do you build hermetic packages?<span class="sc-faq-mk">+</span></summary><div class="sc-faq-a">Yes — metal can and ceramic bodies, sealed by cap weld or seam seal under nitrogen, and leak tested before they ship.</div></details><details class="sc-faq"><summary>How is the seal verified?<span class="sc-faq-mk">+</span></summary><div class="sc-faq-a">Every sealed part gets both a fine and a gross leak test. Hermeticity is measured rather than inferred from the process.</div></details><details class="sc-faq"><summary>When does a device need a hermetic package rather than a molded one?<span class="sc-faq-mk">+</span></summary><div class="sc-faq-a">Where the die requires protection from moisture, or where the device requires a cavity above the active surface, as with a laser diode, VCSEL, or moving MEMS structure. Where a controlled cavity is not required, molded packaging may provide a simpler package architecture.</div></details><details class="sc-faq"><summary>Can the package have an optical window?<span class="sc-faq-mk">+</span></summary><div class="sc-faq-a">Yes. TO-56 takes a window lens, and TO-8B in 16 leads is used where the MEMS mirror requires an optical path through the package. Ceramic bodies can carry an epoxy-dispensed diffuser instead.</div></details><details class="sc-faq"><summary>What kinds of device do you seal?<span class="sc-faq-mk">+</span></summary><div class="sc-faq-a">Laser diodes and VCSELs, MEMS mirrors, avalanche photodiodes with their TIA, RF power transistors, PIN diodes and pulse transformers.</div></details></div></div></div></div>
